  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/Luk2wi3b?style=flat&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載量\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1172843?style=flat&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載量\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252felytra_chestplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/elytra-chestplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/vipvincent/elytra_chestplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvipvincent.github.io%252fwiki%252fen%252felytra_chestplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a> | <a href=\"https://discord.gg/3BKAydVfDk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<h1>鞘翅胸甲</h1>\n<p><strong>此資料包需要所有玩家安裝資源包。</strong><br>\n下載處： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/elytra-chestplate/files/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/elytra-chestplate/files/</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1497/849/screenshot-1-png.png\" alt=\"遊戲截圖\"></p>\n<p>胸甲與鞘翅可透過鍛造台合成，並同時裝備於玩家身上使用，且兩者功能皆可正常運作。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>胸甲與鞘翅可同時裝備並顯示</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>合成</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>合成時會保留胸甲原有的附魔、耐久度與命名，但鞘翅上的附魔不會被保留。目前鞘翅胸甲無法拆解。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1497/853/craft-png.png\" alt=\"合成配方\"></p>\n<h2>下載</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/elytra-chestplate/files/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/elytra-chestplate/files/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資源包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>",
